msgstr "Faites recommander votre boutique par ChatGPT, Perplexity et Claude"

#: includes/class-feedtrix-settings.php:392
msgid "More and more customers ask AI assistants what to buy. FeedTrix prepares your catalog so that AI understands it, recommends your products and sends buyers to your store."
msgstr "De plus en plus de clients demandent aux assistants IA quoi acheter. FeedTrix prépare votre catalogue pour que l'IA le comprenne, recommande vos produits et envoie des acheteurs vers votre boutique."

#: includes/class-feedtrix-settings.php:406
msgid "Visible in AI answers"
msgstr "Visible dans les réponses de l'IA"

#: includes/class-feedtrix-settings.php:406
msgid "/llms.txt and JSON-LD generated from your catalog, updated after every price or stock change."
msgstr "/llms.txt et JSON-LD générés à partir de votre catalogue, mis à jour après chaque changement de prix ou de stock."

#: includes/class-feedtrix-settings.php:407
msgid "See which AI bots visit your store and which pages they read."
msgstr "Découvrez quels bots IA visitent votre boutique et quelles pages ils lisent."

#: includes/class-feedtrix-settings.php:408
msgid "Sales from AI"
msgstr "Ventes issues de l'IA"

#: includes/class-feedtrix-settings.php:408
msgid "Orders from customers who came from AI assistants, in one report."
msgstr "Les commandes des clients venus des assistants IA, dans un seul rapport."

